            "value": "<p><em>Leo &mdash; 3rd (Cloth Ability) Technique, gained at level 11.</em></p><p><em>You are in more places than one, briefly, and each of them is punching.</em></p><p>Make <strong>three unarmed Strikes</strong> against any creatures within 30 feet at <strong>no increase to your multiple attack penalty</strong>. The activity counts as three attacks for your multiple attack penalty afterward.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> At 17th level, add one Strike.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
